rascal-tools ships two models exported to ONNX (MODEL.md). Each is redistributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (the licence text is LICENSE at the root of the rascal repository
and travels with every bundle); this file is the notice of the changes made.

OWLv2 base, patch 16
  Source: https://huggingface.co/google/owlv2-base-patch16, revision
  2a1560802f8cf3c408fec9b809d705f56a2f7146, licensed Apache-2.0 by its authors (Google).
  Changes: the PyTorch checkpoint was exported to ONNX (opset 18) through Transformers'
  Owlv2ForObjectDetection with torch.onnx.export on 2026-10-29, as owlv2-base-patch16.onnx;
  the CLIP tokenizer was saved as owlv2-base-patch16.tokenizer.json. Weights are unchanged.

SAM 2.1 Hiera-Tiny
  Source: https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam2.1-hiera-tiny, revision
  de431c4043854a71d8101e17995dfe596bf101a5, licensed Apache-2.0 by its authors (Meta).
  Changes: the PyTorch checkpoint was exported to ONNX (opset 18) through Transformers'
  Sam2Model with torch.onnx.export on 2026-10-29, as two graphs, the image encoder
  (sam2.1-hiera-tiny.encoder.onnx) and the prompt encoder with the mask decoder taking box
  prompts and returning one mask per box (sam2.1-hiera-tiny.decoder.onnx). Weights are
  unchanged.

The export procedure, the graphs' interfaces and the parity checks are in MODEL.md; the
digests of the exported files are in artifacts.toml.
